# mgweld.msg - Deputy Weld, the robot at the gate (mgweld.ssl).
# 100 to 199 looks and floating lines, 200 and up conversation. One entry per line.

{100}{}{You see Deputy Weld.}
{101}{}{A pre-War robot on battered treads, its brain case scratched milky. Somebody has riveted a tin star to the chassis and painted a mustache beneath the sensor band. The star is the straighter of the two.}

# 110, 111: the welcome, before and after the bomb is disarmed. 112 to 114: stock lines.
# 115: a stock line for a town whose bomb is dead. 120: hostile.
{110}{}{Howdy, traveller. Megaton welcomes you. Please be advised: the bomb has not gone off.}
{111}{}{Howdy, traveller. Megaton welcomes you. Please be advised: the bomb has been disarmed. This unit takes full credit.}
{112}{}{Friendly reminder, pardner: discharging a firearm voids your welcome.}
{113}{}{Stray brahmin will be impounded. Stray visitors likewise.}
{114}{}{Y'all enjoy your stay. The bomb has not gone off.}
{115}{}{Y'all enjoy your stay. The bomb has been disarmed. Your continued existence is appreciated.}
{120}{}{Directive three! Sheriff! Directive three!}

{200}{}{Howdy, traveller. Megaton welcomes you. Please be advised: the bomb has not gone off.}
{201}{}{Howdy, traveller. Megaton welcomes you. Please be advised: the bomb has been disarmed. This unit takes full credit.}
{210}{}{What is this place?}
{211}{}{What bomb?}
{212}{}{Run a self-diagnostic, deputy.}
{213}{}{Shiny man talk!}
{214}{}{Carry on, deputy.}
{220}{}{This here is Megaton. Population: variable. Sheriff Simms keeps the peace. Liquor at Moriarty's Saloon, hot food at the Brass Lantern, sundries at Craterside Supply, sutures at the clinic. Please enjoy all four in moderation.}
{221}{}{I'm looking for a Vault. Or a GECK.}
{222}{}{That query exceeds this unit's jurisdiction, pardner. Mister Moriarty at the saloon retains information. He also retains payment.}
{230}{}{The bomb has not gone off.}
{231}{}{You said that already.}
{232}{}{The bomb has not gone off. This is a report of past performance. Future explosions fall outside this unit's jurisdiction.}
{233}{}{The bomb has been disarmed. This unit's successful record of announcing no explosions remains unbroken.}
{240}{}{Diagnostic. Directive one: greet. Directive two: deter. Directive three: summon the sheriff. Deterrence hardware: not fitted. Override terminal: sheriff's residence, closet. That last item was confidential. Howdy.}
{250}{}{HOW-DY. TRAV-EL-LER. ME-GA-TON. WEL-COMES. YOU. THE BOMB. HAS NOT. GONE OFF.}
{251}{}{Shiny man nice.}
